      "startTime": 45.86,
      "templateId": "FaceOnly"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "paragraph": "In Module 2, we delve into the \"why\" behind coaching. We'll explore theories and approaches that explain how leaders change their thinking and how coaching operates within complex organizational systems.",
