    {
      "data": {
        "paragraph": "Jordan, a director of strategy, came to his first coaching session with a detailed agenda on team performance issues (misdeadlines, communication breakdowns, low initiative). He was ready for a diagnostic approach.",
        "title": "Case Example: Jordan's Team Issues",
        "variant": "paragraph"
      },
      "durationInFrames": 720,
      "endTime": 416.02,
      "startTime": 392.02,
      "templateId": "PostcardParagraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {},
      "durationInFrames": 391,
      "endTime": 429.06,
      "startTime": 416.02,
      "templateId": "FaceOnly"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "paragraph": "Clara, his coach, set the agenda aside and asked about a time when his team worked really well. Jordan described a successful product launch where collaboration was high and results exceeded expectations.",
        "title": "Clara's Approach: Shifting Perspective",
        "variant": "paragraph"
      },
      "durationInFrames": 816,
      "endTime": 456.28,
      "startTime": 429.06,
      "templateId": "PostcardParagraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {},
      "durationInFrames": 459,
      "endTime": 471.58,
      "startTime": 456.28,
      "templateId": "FaceOnly"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "definition": "“I think I’ve been managing the team like a portfolio instead of leading it.”",
        "term": "Jordan's Insight"
      },
      "durationInFrames": 187,
      "endTime": 477.84,
      "startTime": 471.58,
      "templateId": "DefinitionCard"
    },
    {
      "data": {},
      "durationInFrames": 216,
      "endTime": 485.04,
      "startTime": 477.84,
      "templateId": "FaceOnly"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "paragraph": "Jordan's insight didn't come from Clara's analysis but from the conditions she created. Conditions that made Jordan feel trusted and capable rather than being treated as a problem to solve.",
        "title": "Creating Conditions for Insight",
        "variant": "paragraph"
      },
      "durationInFrames": 566,
      "endTime": 503.94,
      "startTime": 485.04,
      "templateId": "PostcardParagraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {},
      "durationInFrames": 505,
      "endTime": 520.8,
      "startTime": 503.94,
      "templateId": "FaceOnly"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "layout": "halfscreen",
        "points": [
          "Recall a situation where someone approached you as capable.",
          "How did it affect what you were willing to try or say?",
          "What specific actions communicated confidence in your capability?",
          "How did it change your thinking about the situation?"
        ],
        "title": "Reflection on Being Treated as Capable"
      },
      "durationInFrames": 646,
      "endTime": 542.36,
      "startTime": 520.8,
      "templateId": "Takeaways"
    },
    {
